# 25. EXAM TRAPS

> **One suspicious log = confirmed attack**

False.

> **SIEM automatically understands every attack**

False.

> **Logs are only useful after an incident**

False.

Logs are also useful for proactive monitoring and detection.

> **More logs always means better security**

False.

Poor-quality or excessive logs can create noise and increase storage/analysis costs.

